OL,3,AMan killed by tiger died from 'multiple
OL,4,Ainjuries'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior coroner Nicola Mundy said he had
OL,7,Fa history of mental illness, a
OL,8,Fdiagnosis of schizophrenia and had
OL,9,Fsuffered previous bouts of psychosis.
OL,10,FHis family had raised concerns about
OL,11,Fhis contact with Rotherham, Doncaster
OL,12,Fand South Humber NHS Trust, the hearing
OL,13,Fwas told.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
